'' hc/pub's public header brings hcstd.bi's MACROS first, so hcdef.bi -- carried by hc/w's
'' interface -- declares none of its '#ifndef'-guarded consts, and interface text is not
'' macro-expanded: hc/w's 'p as any ptr = HC_NULL' was TKO0675 here (the shape of vendor/SDL3
'' then a module including windows.bi, whose NULL / MAX_PATH defaults failed). The interface
'' spells the literals now. Output as fbc gives for one unit with the consts.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 --no-module-cache -i tests/modules/src/hdrconst/libs tests/modules/src/hdrconst/app/pubfirst.tiko -o tests/modules/hdrconstp.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0
'' RUN: tests/modules/hdrconstp.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  260            5.5           4             260
